Your document describes a conversation dated February 12, 2025, in which I =
discussed withdrawing my job application. I applied for that job on the nig=
ht of February 12. I did not withdraw it until February 16. A conversation =
about my withdrawal could not have
 happened on the day I applied. The date is false. And the rest of your sto=
ry depends on it.</div>
<div class=3D"x_x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; m=
argin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,=
Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
And your document says I withdrew &quot;because&quot; your supervisor asked=
 what my plans were for the summer. On March 5, 2025, on tape, that supervi=
sor says she &quot;interpreted&quot; my withdrawal as a response to somethi=
ng she said, and confirms I never made it an issue with
 her. The author of your document knew that recording existed =97 she calle=
d me about it on March 10, 2025. She printed the interpretation as fact any=
way.</div>
<div class=3D"x_x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; m=
argin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,=
Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
Your document is wrong that way throughout, and every event it describes is=
 already in the record: the emails, the recordings, all of it public and li=
nked. That is why I documented everything contemporaneously.</div>
<div class=3D"x_x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; m=
argin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,=
Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
The last edit to your document was January 21, 2026. Its final entry is my =
notice of a lawsuit. Six weeks later, the document was in the hands of the =
Oregon State Police, and two months after its last edit, armed officers cam=
e to my door. Your own document
 records nothing in between: no threat, no crime, no new event. A legal not=
ice, and then police.</div>
<div class=3D"x_x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; m=
argin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,=
